{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新世界發展與招商局置地合作發展的將軍澳百勝角通風樓物業發展項目，日前動工，預計提供約600伙住宅。</p><p></p><p>百勝角通風樓物業發展項目，毗鄰港鐵坑口站，坐落發展成熟地段，區內生活配套完善。項目可建住宅樓面面積約29萬平方呎，設有會所及停車場，將提供約600伙住宅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:49.899179+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:58:01.784870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:46.498326+00:00","content_hash":"3c57d057625017c2a25bf0f382c111c586107f1b0b735f1c3a53e3c3dbcdd646","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}